      "id": 1,
      "name": "full-channel-audit",
      "prompt": "Hey can you audit my YouTube channel? It's https://youtube.com/@mrbeast — I want to know why my videos aren't getting as many views as I'd like. I've been at this for a while but something feels off. Please go deep on thumbnails, titles, CTR, retention, and what I should change about my content strategy. Also how can I monetize better?",
